ind":"update","title":"UPDATE 0.1.3","summary":"Hello everyone,This is just a small update:QOL on tutorial tooltips and other tooltipsAI bidder balancingSelected character now carries over between play sessionsFixed bug where peak net worth would carry over through profile resetsFixed bug where warrior passive gold wouldn't carry over between play sessionsYou guys are going crazy on the leaderboard! I'll catch up soon just wait... - coconuts","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T04:05:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814452131","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4950060-1842212951297820","game_id":"steam-4950060","kind":"announcement","title":"UPATE 0.1.2","summary":"Hello everyone,This is just a small update:Fixed bug where auction buy-in amount wasn't being deductedFixed leaderboard UI sizing Added leaderboard entries for players below the top 10General loot balancing It's great to see everyone playing! As I said, I will continue to be on the lookout for anything to fix or add. Don't hesitate to join the discord and contact me if you notice anything. - coconutsP.S. \"Did you skip update 0.1.1?\" I didn't even announce update 0.1.1 because it was so small... ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T18:26:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297820","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4950060-1842212951295307","game_id":"steam-4950060","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO IS LIVE!","summary":"Hello everyone, As promised, the demo for Bid Wars has been set live! Feel free to try it out for yourself or tell your friends and enter auctions against each other! Rest assured t